            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.79</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Two more Kling models.</b> Kling 3 is the non-turbo Kling 3.0 in 720p, 1080p and 4K with an optional soundtrack and an end frame on every tier; its silent 720p clips cost less per second than Kling Turbo. Kling O3 brings the O3 family in 720p and 1080p with sound, start and end frames, and a reference mode that follows one reference video plus up to four character images. Kling Turbo and Kling O3 4K stay as they are.</li>
<li><b>Sound is a visible price decision.</b> Kling 3 and Kling O3 show the Sound switch; with sound on, a second costs about a third more in 720p and 1080p, 4K is priced the same either way. The quote always shows the exact amount before you generate.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
